WEBVTT

00:18:59.079 --> 00:19:02.579
and then it ends up being kind of
this beautiful symphony. Mm hmm.

00:19:02.871 --> 00:19:07.288
I imagine, J.J. , you've seen a lot of
this in in the world of Hollywood.

00:19:07.413 --> 00:19:10.371
Is there is there one or the other
that you think is more common

00:19:10.371 --> 00:19:14.163
or more effective? And are there are
there are people who do more of

00:19:14.163 --> 00:19:16.746
the thinking versus rethinking
in your collaborations?

00:19:17.413 --> 00:19:19.704
Well, obviously, I think, you know,
everyone is different.

00:19:19.704 --> 00:19:24.496
And I know I have worked with
people who who go to a place

00:19:24.496 --> 00:19:27.288
and not that they're stubborn
about where they go,

00:19:27.288 --> 00:19:29.704
but they arrive at an answer very,
very quickly.

00:19:29.704 --> 00:19:35.204
And that's sort of their thing and that
they're perhaps a bit reluctant to be